<title>USA: NYS Dormitory Authority $22 mln issue repriced.</title>
<headline>NYS Dormitory Authority $22 mln issue repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A $22 million New York State Dormitory Authority issue was repriced by First Albany Corp., with some coupons adjusted.</p>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $22,500,000*</p>
<p>TERESIAN HOUSE</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AGREEMENT.</p>
<p>THE COUPONS WILL NOT BE FINALIZED UNTIL TOMORROW MORNING.</p>
